Deck picture library
Made by the IBM Bob Skills Marketplace team for the presentations pack.

The 72 pictures in pack-a, pack-b, pack-c, pack-d, pack-e, pack-f and pack-g were generated by the pack authors from the
prompts in references/library.md (Gemini, 2026-09-11), cropped to 16:9 and saved as JPEG.
They are supplied as part of this pack under the pack's licence. They show no real people,
no real places presented as fact, no logos and no trademarks. A slide that uses one says
"AI-generated image" in its speaker notes; manifest.json lists every picture with keywords.
